this is as permanent as.

00:00:38.517 --> 00:00:40.332
Are you saying you think this
is gonna be the Smithsonian?

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:41.765
No, I was not.

00:00:41.765 --> 00:00:43.183
That's a little pompous of you.

00:00:43.183 --> 00:00:45.526
I agree, 'cause that's
not what I was saying.

00:00:45.526 --> 00:00:47.705
What does that even really
mean anymore, though,

00:00:47.705 --> 00:00:49.236
to be the Smithsonian?

00:00:49.236 --> 00:00:52.193
And that's what we're tackling today,

00:00:52.193 --> 00:00:54.153
new year, new issues.
What does that really mean

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:54.995
to be the Smithsonian Institution Museum.

00:00:54.995 --> 00:00:57.252
Who cares about the Smithsonian?

00:00:57.252 --> 00:00:58.780
I like the Smithsonian,

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.578
