00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.263
I could go camping tonight.

00:05:15.263 --> 00:05:17.181
You could bug out, you
have a bug out vehicle now.

00:05:17.181 --> 00:05:20.149
I have everything except food.

00:05:20.149 --> 00:05:20.982
Okay.

00:05:20.982 --> 00:05:23.460
Food and water, but equipment

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:27.331
and lights.
It's stored there permanent?

00:05:27.331 --> 00:05:30.030
Ways to start fire and
tools, and all that stuff,

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:33.320
