cooking stuff, it's all in there.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:34.232
See, if I owned a van.

00:05:34.232 --> 00:05:35.280
You'd be ready to go.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.552
I'd have one of those too

00:05:36.552 --> 00:05:41.100
