00:05:47.999 --> 00:05:49.150
No drawer's as big as my drawer.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.620
No big-ass back metal drawer, no.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:51.453
A lot of little drawers,

00:05:51.453 --> 00:05:53.030
I don't think a lot of little drawers

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.237
