there's stories to tell,

01:07:31.417 --> 01:07:33.250
so we're gonna talk about.

01:07:33.250 --> 01:07:35.600
The holidays.
The holiday break.

01:07:35.600 --> 01:07:36.648
Whatever came from that.
Next week.

01:07:36.648 --> 01:07:38.517
